   - Key Vault URL: https://myvault.vault.azure.net
   - Key Name: my-encryption-key
   - Storage Account: https://mystorageaccount.blob.core.windows.net
   - Container: encrypted-blobs

2. Setting up encryption services...
   - Container ready

